1795344238139	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-4479717553355470809"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:43:58.139-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:43:58.140-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-sumer3"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-sumer"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"उरुक सहर: मानव सभ्यताको पहिलो महानगर"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"त्यो पहिलो महानगर, जहाँ मानिसले आफ्ना सुरुवाती अक्षरहरू भेटे दक्षिणी मेसोपोटामियाको माटोको फाँटबाट उठेको उरुक मानव इतिहासकै पहिलो विशाल महानगर बन्यो। “जसले अथाह गहिराइ देखे, भूमिको जग चिने, जो सबै बाटाका ज्ञाता थिए, हर कुरामा विवेकी थिए।” यिनै पङ्क्तिबाट सुरु हुन्छ द एपिक अफ गिलगामेश (The Epic of Gilgamesh) — राजसत्ता, शोक, अमरत्वको खोज र एकपटक सिङ्गो संसार निल्ने महाप्रलयको कथा। स.पू. २८०० तिर रच"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/4479717553355470809/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/uruk-sahar-manav-sabhyatako-pahilo-mahanagar-ra-akshar.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/4479717553355470809"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/4479717553355470809"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/uruk-sahar-manav-sabhyatako-pahilo-mahanagar-ra-akshar.html","title":"उरुक सहर: मानव सभ्यताको पहिलो महानगर"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.co